<h1>Swadam Foods Product Catalog API</h1>
<p>A public, read-only machine-readable catalog of Swadam Foods products.</p>
<h2>Endpoints</h2>
<ul>
<li><code>GET /api/products</code> — product names, pack sizes, prices, availability and preparation information.</li>
<li><code>GET /api/status</code> — catalog service health status.</li>
</ul>
<p>Orders are placed directly with Swadam Foods through WhatsApp at +91 88888 51522.</p>
<p>OpenAPI description: <a href="https://swadamfoods.eu.cc/.well-known/service-desc">/.well-known/service-desc</a></p>
